{"4132190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Raptor Evolution", "steam_appid": 4132190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4134570, 4134580, 4134590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132190/extras/5f8c2521158bcd7b646ccd6254e3964d.avif?t=1785924190\" width=600 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hunt begins now! Take control of a mighty dinosaur in a post-apocalyptic world on a quest to recover its stolen eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132190/extras/b0920e08463bbb7c50bee8e0bad291bd.poster.avif?t=1785924190\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132190/extras/b0920e08463bbb7c50bee8e0bad291bd.webm?t=1785924190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132190/extras/b0920e08463bbb7c50bee8e0bad291bd.mp4?t=1785924190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast landscapes, uncover hidden secrets and face terrifying bosses standing between you and your lost brood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Break everything: destroy environments and leave nothing standing<br>- Use advanced technology: encounter futuristic machines that will aid your survival<br>- Engage in fierce battles: hunt down mutants and monstrous creatures<br>- Meet various enemies: take on diverse foes with unique behaviors<br>- Lead your warriors: command other beasts and dominate the wasteland<br>- Evolve to become a super beast: grow stronger with every challen